OL,3,ACatholic bishops apologise for
OL,4,A'exploited' Trump meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Catholic bishops in the US have
OL,7,Fsaid they regret meeting President
OL,8,FDonald Trump at the White House, after
OL,9,Fimages of them praying with him were
OL,10,Freleased and prompted many to ask if
OL,11,Fthey were making a political statement.
OL,13,FPhotos and video of the 22 October
OL,14,Fmeeting show a group of bishops
OL,15,Fstanding around Trump at the Resolute
OL,16,FDesk in the Oval Office.
OL,18,FMilwaukee Archbishop Jeffrey Grob, one
OL,19,Fof those pictured, said he had believed
OL,20,Fthe meeting was private and not "a
OL,21,Fpolitical photo opportunity".
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
